<title>HONG KONG: Magician interim profit rises 14.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Magician interim profit rises 14.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.32  vs  14.51</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    39.97  vs  34.82</p>
<p>    Turnover		     297.08 vs  241.70</p>
<p>    Company name		 Magician Industries (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 14-17</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 23</p>
<p>NOTE - General housewares maker Magician Industries was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on October 11, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
